WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.390
Why do 3, 4 and 5 make a perfect right angle?

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:07.040
Build a square on each side of the triangle.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:11.060
3 squared is 9, and 4 squared is 16.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.670
Move all 25 little squares onto the longest side.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:20.920
They fit exactly. 9 plus 16 is 25, which is 5 squared.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:28.010
That is Pythagoras: a squared plus b squared equals c squared.
